  "scope": "Public Rust SDK handoff and Connection device replacement through actual signed listeners, captured original operation identity and managed audio. SDK controls use independent public Canonical native media owners. Local macOS arm64 functional scope; this does not qualify both-ends SDK media or complete G6-060.",
